      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.28</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>When a .NET program crashes, its log now contains the exception type, message and stack (from the Windows event log), and &quot;Last run&quot; shows the exception type instead of a bare exception code.</li><li>Changing the Windows version and other service commands are no longer reported as crashes when something else in the bottle fails while Wine starts.</li><li>The problem report form now reminds you to leave an e-mail: without it the developer can&#x27;t reply or ask for details.</li></ul>]]></description>
